        "original_id": "3d15e5ae-f8de-521d-a998-563a01a20af5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Huevos a la mexicana, Refried beans\n- Concepts: Mexican cuisine, Tex-Mex cuisine, cooking steps\n\nFacts:\n- In Huevos a la mexicana, the heat is turned off before coriander leaves are mixed into the eggs with salt.\n- Refried beans, called \"frijoles refritos\" in Spanish, are a dish of cooked and mashed beans.\n- Refried beans are a traditional staple of Mexican cuisine and Tex-Mex cuisine.\n- Mexican cuisine and Tex-Mex cuisine use different approaches to make refried beans.",
